        jTextArea1.setText("DENTAL CLINIC SYSTEM - HELP / USER GUIDE\n\n\n1. HOW TO LOGIN\n------------------------------\n1. Enter your username.\n2. Enter your password.\n3. Click the LOGIN button.\n4. If the details are correct, the Dashboard will open.\n\n\n2. HOW TO REGISTER PATIENT\n------------------------------\n1. Open Patient Management from the Dashboard.\n2. Enter the patient's details.\n3. Check that all required fields are filled.\n4. Click SAVE.\n5. The new patient will appear in the patient table.\n\n\n3. HOW TO CREATE APPOINTMENT\n------------------------------\n1. Open Appointment Management.\n2. Select or enter the patient.\n3. Select the dentist.\n4. Select the treatment.\n5. Select the appointment date and time.\n6. Enter the required details.\n7. Click SAVE.\n8. The appointment will appear in the appointment table.\n\n\n4. HOW TO CREATE BILL\n------------------------------\n1. Open Bill Management.\n2. Select the relevant patient or appointment.\n3. Enter/select the required treatment details.\n4. Check the treatment fee and total amount.\n5. Click SAVE.\n6. The bill will be saved successfully.\n\n\n5. HOW TO SEARCH APPOINTMENT\n------------------------------\n1. Open Appointment Management.\n2. Enter or select the search criteria.\n3. Click SEARCH.\n4. The matching appointment records will be displayed in the table.\n5. Select a record to view its details.\n\n\n6. HOW TO PRINT BILL\n------------------------------\n1. Open Bill Management.\n2. Search or select the required bill.\n3. Check the bill details.\n4. Click the PRINT button.\n5. Select the required printer.\n6. Confirm printing.\n\n\n7. HOW TO LOGOUT\n------------------------------\n1. Complete your work.\n2. Return to the Dashboard.\n3. Click the LOGOUT button.\n4. The system will return to the Login screen.\n5. Do not close the system without logging out.\n\n\nIMPORTANT NOTES\n------------------------------\n• Always check patient details before saving.\n• Check appointment date and time carefully.\n• Verify bill amounts before printing.\n• Do not share your username or password.\n• Logout after completing your work.");
